:3095114704,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64e7PQ","user":{"login":"vinpix","id":76024897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDI0ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76024897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix","html_url":"https://github.com/vinpix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T03:29:39Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T03:29:39Z","body":"[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21339714/mrp.zip)\n\nI’ve attached the MRP — you can open and verify that it works correctly in Godot 4.4.1.\n\nTo reproduce the bug in 4.5:\n\nOpen the project in 4.5.\n\nClick Project → Tools → Upgrade Project Files.\n\nLet the engine reimport the assets automatically (especially the 3D models).\n\nYou'll see the export goes through, but the 3D models appear broken/invisible/distorted in the resulting build.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095114704/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095216477","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108805#issuecomment-3095216477","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108805","id":3095216477,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64fUFd","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T04:59:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T04:59:50Z","body":"> You'll see the export goes through, but the 3D models appear broken/invisible/distorted in the resulting build.\n\nExport or import? Are you running the exported project on the Android (seems to work fine on Android, but MRP has no main scene or camera), or opening the project in the Android editor (I can't reproduce it either)?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095216477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095225085","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108805#issuecomment-3095225085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108805","id":3095225085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64fWL9","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T05:06:38Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T05:06:38Z","body":"> Error Couldn't load project data at path \".\" is the .pck file missing?\n\nIf you are using Gradle build, make sure to update Android source in the project (remove and reinstall `android` folder) after moving to 4.5.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095225085/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095707019","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108805#issuecomment-3095707019","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108805","id":3095707019,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64hL2L","user":{"login":"vinpix","id":76024897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDI0ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76024897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix","html_url":"https://github.com/vinpix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T08:24:53Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T08:24:53Z","body":"Thanks for the follow-up. Let me clarify the issue a bit more clearly:\n\nWhen I upgraded my project from Godot 4.4.1 to 4.5, the project itself opened and ran fine in the editor. However, exporting to Android failed with this error:\n\nError Couldn't load project data at path \".\" is the .pck file missing? If you've renamed the executable, the associated .pck file should also be renamed to match the executable name (without the extension).\n\n(I had already installed the latest Android export templates for 4.5.)\n\n\nTo debug this, I created a clean Godot 4.5 project and manually re-added all the assets from the original one. The new project exported to Android successfully at first.\n\n\nLater I discovered the root cause: the issue was with the 3D models. Once I reimported them, the export no longer showed the .pck error — but the models appeared broken or invisible in the exported Android build (distorted geometry, missing materials, etc.).\n\nSo to summarize:\n\n\nThe .pck error seems to happen before reimporting models.\n\nAfter reimporting models, the .pck error disappears, but the models are visually broken in the Android build.\n\nthis is the video \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72b913ae-e5e3-4b29-a0a8-52f70a4482b7","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095707019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095870520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108805#issuecomment-3095870520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108805","id":3095870520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64hzw4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T09:22:53Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T09:22:53Z","body":"I can't reproduce it with your MRP, reimporting seems to work fine (tested in editor on macOS 15.5 and Android), exported Android project also display meshes fine (if missing camera is added to the MRP).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3095870520/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3098476199","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108805#issuecomment-3098476199","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108805","id":3098476199,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64rv6n","user":{"login":"vinpix","id":76024897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDI0ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76024897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix","html_url":"https://github.com/vinpix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vinpix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T20:08:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T20:08:58Z","body":"Hey, I can let you use my computer via AnyDesk this weekend if that helps with reproducing or debugging the issue. Feel free to reach out to me on Instagram to coordinate: [@anh_luomm](https://www.instagram.com/anh_luomm/). Let me know what time works best for you!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3098476199/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https:/