3676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108805","id":3109693676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65Wijs","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-23T18:35:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-23T18:35:58Z","body":"> I just found the root cause - it’s related to the image import settings. When the images were imported using VRAM Compression, it seems to break the Android export in 4.5. Changing the import mode to Lossless, Uncompressed, or another compression type fixes the issue.\n\nDid you enable ETC2 ASTC compression in the Project Settings? It's required for mobile exports to work, as mobile platforms expect different formats than desktop.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3109693676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3109715315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issue